CC
CC	  PS  chr  phaseSetStart  phaseSetEnd
CC	  FL  chr  filterStart    filterEnd
CC	  M?  chr  PS  pos  allele0  allele1  hetIndex  #supports0  #errors0  #supp1  #err1
